{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"zai-org/CodeGeeX","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/107","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/107/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/107/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/107/events","html_url":"https://github.com/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/107","id":1655144380,"node_id":"I_kwDOIA6XT85ip3-8","number":107,"title":"使用 test_prompt.txt 输入，但生成后有很多额外的题和代码","user":{"login":"airlsyn","id":1772912,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NzI5MTI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1772912?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn","html_url":"https://github.com/airlsyn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/airlsyn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2023-04-05T08:09:49Z","updated_at":"2023-11-28T09:59:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"参数与 test_inference.sh 一致。\r\n\r\n使用 test_prompt.txt 输入，但生成后，有很多额外的题和代码\r\n\r\n```\r\nCurrent prompt:\r\ncode translation\r\nJava:\r\npublic class Solution {\r\n    public static boolean hasCloseElements(int[] nums, int threshold) {\r\n        for (int i = 0; i < nums.length - 1; i++) {\r\n            for (int j = i + 1; j < nums.length; j++) {\r\n                if (Math.abs(nums[i] - nums[j]) < threshold) {\r\n                    return true;\r\n                }\r\n            }\r\n        }\r\n        return false;\r\n    }\r\n}\r\nPython:\r\nN_token_prompt: 126\r\n\r\nGenerated code 1921:\r\n\r\n\r\nimport math\r\ndef hasCloseElements(nums, threshold):\r\n    for i in range(len(nums)-1):\r\n        for j in range(i+1, len(nums)):\r\n            if abs(nums[i]-nums[j]) < threshold:\r\n                return True\r\n    return False\r\n\r\n\\```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## 38. Count and Say\r\n\r\n[原题链接](https://leetcode-cn.com/problems/count-and-say/)\r\n\r\n### 解一：基本\r\n\r\n首先以一个 `1` 开始，每遇到 `2` 则把后面的 `1` 翻转，把当前的 `2` 与前面 `1` 的结果相加，这样就得到了输入 `1` 中的每一个 `1` 的结果。\r\n\r\n```python\r\nclass Solution(object):\r\n    def countAndSay(self, n):\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        :type n: int\r\n        :rtype: str\r\n        \"\"\"\r\n        if n == 1:\r\n            return '1'\r\n        result = '1'\r\n        for i in range(n-1):\r\n            pre = result\r\n            result = ''\r\n            count = 1\r\n            for c in pre:\r\n                if c!= pre[0]:\r\n                    result += str(count) + c\r\n                    count = 1\r\n                else:\r\n                    count += 1\r\n        return result\r\n```\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/107/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zai-org/CodeGeeX/issues/107/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":nul